<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Voxware Inc below range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Voxware Inc below range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			  Voxware Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $7.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $11-$13</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			  2.7 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The underwriter said the issue would be effective in one hour. The New Jersey-based company specializes in technology for speech processing.</p>
</text>
